{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ、さゆとバーン！\nゆっるーいね。目力がない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、平成狸合戦ぽんぽこ見てる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい。狸かわいいなあ。\nお腹ぽんぽこりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみで寝れないときどうしてる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの前とかいっつもそうだなあ...\nんー、無になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眉毛の形 好き！\n自分で手入れしよると？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクさんにやってもらってるけど\nほとんどいじってない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喉の痛みの治し方教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫ですかああああ\n生姜紅茶飲みましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい猛暑で寝苦しいけど\n扇風機派？クーラー派？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝るとき冷房付けっぱなしですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はクーラー付けて\n家族全員で寝てるー\n首にタオル巻いてるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は、お祭りとか行く予定ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないー\nメンバーと行きたいねーって話してる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遊園地のアトラクションで\n何が一番好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶叫マシンすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪質ってどんな感じ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毛が細い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後のってナタリーの\nオフショットかな！？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもあるからまだ載せますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はブブカさんの取材が\nありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいしゃべりました！\nお楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/12/3901134/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田行きたかったなあ。\n秋田イベントメンバーがんばれ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}